    "diagnosis": "<p>Syndrome-associated schwannoma </p>",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "<p>On MRI, a longitudinally extensive and/or multicentric/discontinuous-appearing nerve sheath tumour such as this should raise suspicion of a tumour predisposition syndrome such as schwannomatosis or neurofibromatosis type&nbsp;2.</p>",
