    "diagnosis": "Syndrome-associated schwannoma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "The histology from the same case illustrated in &lt;&lt;#5655&gt;&gt;Fig.&nbsp;#5655 similarly showed a multicentric or multinodular appearance.",
