    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Syndrome-associated schwannoma",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "The mosaic pattern of SMARCB1 (INI1) immunostaining in the same case illustrated in &lt;&lt;#5655&gt;&gt;Fig.&nbsp;#5655 and &lt;&lt;#5656&gt;&gt;Fig.&nbsp;#5656 further suggests that this schwannoma is arising as part of a syndrome, such as schwannomatosis or neurofibromatosis type&nbsp;2.",
